WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:20.585
Eddy drove to the construction site.

2
00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:23.653
He went slowly.

3
00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:30.768
He didn't want to crash again.

4
00:00:30.769 --> 00:00:35.104
"Hey, Jeb," said Eddy.

5
00:00:35.105 --> 00:00:50.099
"Let's play in the dirt!"

6
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:54.840
Poppy and Dipper drove over.

7
00:00:54.841 --> 00:00:57.521
"Eddy!" said Poppy.

8
00:00:57.522 --> 00:01:00.671
"Don't you want to play tag?"

9
00:01:00.672 --> 00:01:05.285
"No," said Eddy.

10
00:01:05.286 --> 00:01:09.918
"I don't want to crash again."

11
00:01:09.919 --> 00:01:15.089
Jeb loaded dirt into Eddy's dumper.

12
00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:22.083
Eddy dumped the dirt.

13
00:01:22.084 --> 00:01:25.497
"You won't crash," said Dipper.

14
00:01:25.498 --> 00:01:28.020
"Don't you want to go fast?"

15
00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:40.488
"No," said Eddy.

16
00:01:40.489 --> 00:01:42.847
Zippy drove over.

17
00:01:42.848 --> 00:01:47.146
"Hey, slowpoke!" he said.

18
00:01:47.147 --> 00:01:53.075
"Want to race?"

19
00:01:53.076 --> 00:01:57.248
"Grr!" said Eddy.

20
00:01:57.249 --> 00:02:00.682
"Leave Eddy alone," said Dipper.

21
00:02:00.683 --> 00:02:02.395
"He doesn't want to—"

22
00:02:02.396 --> 00:02:07.112
Roar! Eddy roared his engine.

23
00:02:07.113 --> 00:02:11.126
He quickly checked his brakes.

24
00:02:11.127 --> 00:02:26.940
Then he took off!
